  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger perceived unity and coordination among Western and regional partners (driven by a cohesive response to the Russia‑Ukraine war) raises deterrence costs and coordinated countermeasures, reducing Iran's and its proxies' willingness to initiate or intensify kinetic operations.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
