  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased cohesion among US and allied governments produces coordinated policy agendas and legislative initiatives (investment reviews, national-security screenings, data rules) that raise the intensity of regulatory scrutiny directed at Chinese-linked data-centre projects and providers.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
