  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Visible fractures or defections among key allies over war policy create crises that increase policy coordination burdens, staff turnover and internal disputes in the executive branch, undermining operational steadiness.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-12 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
