  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Large-scale corporate divestments, service suspensions and abrupt contract terminations create concentrated sell orders and counterparty withdrawal, directly reducing liquidity depth in affected equity, bond and derivative markets.</data>
