  <data key="d37">Large firms' operational decisions (account suspensions, content takedowns, regional service changes or algorithm adjustments tied to the war) alter platform availability and distribution algorithms, reducing the speed and reach of certain political information streams domestically.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
