  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Physical disruptions to oil supply trigger frequent official advisories, industry alerts, market commentary and social media speculation, increasing the speed and volume of both verified information and rumors about energy security.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
