  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster and broader dissemination of political information and misinformation accelerates the spread of leaked vulnerabilities and fuels targeted social-engineering campaigns, increasing the frequency and success rate of cyber intrusions and related security incidents against tech infrastructure.</data>
