  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising approval for principal U.S. candidates increases political capital to commit funds and arms publicly, which reassures partners and raises the likelihood of coordinated allied statements and burden-sharing.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_domestic_politics</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
